<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`cnt0`<sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Counter0<sp/>value<sp/>measured<sp/>when<sp/>an<sp/>error<sp/>is<sp/>generated<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
