<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`cnt0`<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Counter0<sp/>value<sp/>measured<sp/>during<sp/>an<sp/>error.<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`cnt1`<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Counter1<sp/>value<sp/>measured<sp/>during<sp/>an<sp/>error.<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">|<sp/>`valid`<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|<sp/>Valid0<sp/>value<sp/>measured<sp/>during<sp/>an<sp/>error.<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>|</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Calculation<sp/>Details</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Since<sp/>Fclk1&gt;Fclk0,<sp/>Async.<sp/>Error<sp/>(In<sp/>Clock0<sp/>cycles)<sp/>=<sp/>2<sp/>+<sp/>2*(Fsysclk/Fclk0)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Digitization<sp/>error<sp/>(In<sp/>Clock0<sp/>cycles)<sp/>=<sp/>8</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>DCC<sp/>Error<sp/>=<sp/>Async.<sp/>Error<sp/>+<sp/>Digitization<sp/>error</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Window<sp/>(in<sp/>Cycles)<sp/>=<sp/>(DCC<sp/>Error)<sp/>/<sp/>(0.01<sp/>*<sp/>Tolerance)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Frequency<sp/>Error<sp/>Allowed<sp/>(In<sp/>Clock0<sp/>Cycles)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>Window<sp/>*<sp/>(Allowable<sp/>Frequency<sp/>Tolerance<sp/>(in<sp/>%)<sp/>/<sp/>100)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Total<sp/>Error<sp/>=<sp/>DCC<sp/>Error<sp/>+<sp/>Frequency<sp/>Error<sp/>Allowed</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Counter0<sp/>=<sp/>Window<sp/>-<sp/>Total<sp/>Error</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Valid0<sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>2<sp/>*<sp/>Total<sp/>Error<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Counter1<sp/>=<sp/>Window<sp/>x<sp/>(Fclk1/Fclk0)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>Above<sp/>calculation<sp/>is<sp/>done<sp/>as<sp/>part<sp/>of<sp/>sysconfig<sp/>in<sp/>this<sp/>example</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
